      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1KI",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 29
        }
      ],
      "en": "As soon as he was king, he struck all the house of Jeroboam. He didn’t leave to Jeroboam any who breathed, until he had destroyed him, according to the saying of the LORD, which he spoke by his servant Ahijah the Shilonite;",
      "ko": "왕이 될 때에 여로보암의 온 집을 쳐서 생명 있는 자를 하나도 남기지 아니하고 다 멸하였는데 여호와께서 그 종 실로 사람 아히야로 하신 말씀과 같이 되었으니",
      "source_text_hash": "55a167f2155d1d8b41273247ac82a2199a03090b32e39e06cd483433aafeb5d7",
      "translation_text_hash": "c845cbdb2464dbf82bfc524dc7a6da6ecc4325829c1694e154fd8289e2155e01",
