      "en": "There was war between Asa and Baasha king of Israel all their days.",
      "ko": "아사와 이스라엘 왕 바아사 사이에 일생 전쟁이 있으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "7db8330fde09e5907ec32a778a3944fcfb10415190fa3f632d8903796e84105c",
      "translation_text_hash": "08decd4062eea02b6e5ad8a6c75c222c5e915b0f666ba9b3325b09628bed39fd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
